OL,3,GNEWSAWhere Vikings, miners and walkers
OL,4,Across paths
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf you have ever assumed Lincolnshire
OL,7,Fis a flat county, then think again.
OL,9,FThe village of Normanby le Wold sits
OL,10,F550ft (168m) above sea level ` the sort
OL,11,Fof climb it is impossible not to feel
OL,12,Fduring a long hike.
OL,14,FWe are following the Viking Way, a
OL,15,F149-mile path from Rutland to the
OL,16,FHumber Estuary which is celebrating its
OL,17,F50th birthday this year.
OL,19,FTo mark the anniversary, BBC Radio
OL,20,FLincolnshire and BBC Radio Humberside
OL,21,Fhave been celebrating the people and
OL,22,Fplaces along the way.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
